        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Morten Sasse Suurballe, Sofie Gråbøl\n- Roles: Detective Chief Inspector Lennart Brix\n- Works: The Killing, Forbrydelsen\n\nFacts:\n- Morten Sasse Suurballe was born on 8 March 1955 and is a Danish actor.\n- Sofie Gråbøl was born on 30 July 1968 and is a Danish actress.\n- Morten Sasse Suurballe is best known for playing Detective Chief Inspector Lennart Brix in the three television series The Killing, also known in Danish as Forbrydelsen.\n- Morten Sasse Suurballe played alongside Sofie Gråbøl in The Killing.",
